      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنْبُثٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنْبُوثٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنَابِثٌ</span> <i>Hard and
strong.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, all the three words, <i>Contracted</i> [<i>in disposition</i>], <i>and niggardly,</i> or <i>stingy.</i>
(K.) Accord. to some, the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span> is a radical letter.
(TA.) [See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كنبث</span>.]

